header: "---\nname: jake-x-x-post\ndescription: \"Write an X (Twitter) post from a raw idea using 21 proven hook formulas, in the user's own voice, counted the way X counts characters and humanized so it does not read as AI. Use whenever the user wants a tweet, an X post, a hook, \\\"post about X\\\", \\\"turn this into a tweet\\\", a long post for Premium, or asks for hook options. Produces three scored hooks, one full draft, and a copy-ready block that is never published without an explicit yes.\"\nlicense: MIT\nmetadata:\n  upstream_repository: Jakeschincariol/x-agent-skill\n  upstream_skill: x-post\n  upstream_commit: 7822c29b4aedbd400b9339839d3f59f3652b1317\nprompt-source: prompt.toon\n---\n"
